      "instruction": {
        "en": "Zigbee Bastien → Wireless Button 2 (TS0042). NOT Homey Zigbee. Wake-tap every 2s while pairing. Homey Flow: Button pressed → lamp — NOT Developer Tools Zigbee channels. Update tip then re-pair if presses were dead/slow.",
        "fr": "Zigbee Bastien → Bouton sans fil 2 (TS0042). PAS Homey Zigbee. Tap toutes les 2 s a l'appairage. Flow: Bouton appuye → lampe — PAS les canaux Zigbee des outils developpeur. Maj tip puis re-appairer si lent/mort.",
        "nl": "Houd enige knop 5s tot LED knippert. Wireless Button 2 — niet Homey Zigbee / Appareil Zigbee.",
        "de": "Beliebige Taste 5s halten bis LED blinkt. Wireless Button 2 — nicht Homey Zigbee."
      }
    }
